437 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 294 0 R
/T (1.2 Overview of global MobilityTech trends and their implications for the sector in Central and Eastern Europe)
/E (1.2 Overview of global MobilityTech trends and their implications for the sector in Central and Eastern Europe)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
438 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 294 0 R
/E (In 2024, the mobility sector in Europe attracted USD 6 billion in funding, marking a 30% decline compared to the previous year. Despite this, it remains among the leading sectors and has consistently ranked in the top 5 VC industries on the continent for over a decade. This is driven by the fact that mobility sits at the intersection of megatrends such as decarbonization, electrification, and digitalization, which are shaping the transformation of the entire economy.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
439 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
