<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 304 0 R
/E (Capital intensive models such as fleets, charging infrastructure, and hardware have been valued for what they are: low margin businesses with long return horizons and regulatory risk. Capital has shifted toward software that manages this infrastructure such as TMS, WMS, orchestration platforms, and route optimization, where the risk profile is closer to traditional B2B SaaS with low initial CAPEX, recurring revenue, and a faster path to unit profitability.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
