/E (The transformation of mobility in Europe is strongly driven by EU regulations and public funding, which enforce fleet modernization and infrastructure expansion, generating structural investment demand further reinforced by urbanization and the development of autonomous transport.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
688 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 304 0 R
