/E (The TSL sector in Poland operates on net margins of 2 to 5%, and nearly 70% of companies have fewer than 50 employees, including as many as 41% with no more than 10 employees. High capital expenditure limits investment, even though digitalization can reduce costs.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [11]
>>
