/E (The planned shift toward more integrated systems, such as the EU Customs Data Hub, represents a move away from fragmented, local processes toward a model based on data management and data quality. The new model assumes the integration of trade, customs, and regulatory data within a single environment, supported by analytics and automation, effectively shifting the center of gravity from physical operations to data management.)
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [7]
>>
